<refentry id="SQL-SELECTINTO">
 <refmeta>
  <refentrytitle id="SQL-SELECTINTO-TITLE">
   SELECT INTO
  </refentrytitle>
  <refmiscinfo>SQL - 语言语句</refmiscinfo>
 </refmeta>
 <refnamediv>
  <refname>
   SELECT INTO
  </refname>
  <refpurpose>
   从一个现有的表或视图创建一个新表
  </refpurpose></refnamediv>
 <refsynopsisdiv>
  <refsynopsisdivinfo>
   <date>1999-07-20</date>
  </refsynopsisdivinfo>
  <synopsis>
SELECT [ ALL | DISTINCT [ ON ( <replaceable class="PARAMETER">expression</replaceable> [, ...] ) ] ]
    <replaceable class="PARAMETER">expression</replaceable> [ AS <replaceable class="PARAMETER">name</replaceable> ] [, ...]
    [ INTO [ TEMPORARY | TEMP ] [ TABLE ] <replaceable class="PARAMETER">new_table</replaceable> ]
    [ FROM <replaceable class="PARAMETER">table</replaceable> [ <replaceable class="PARAMETER">alias</replaceable> ] [, ...] ]
    [ WHERE <replaceable class="PARAMETER">condition</replaceable> ]
    [ GROUP BY <replaceable class="PARAMETER">column</replaceable> [, ...] ]
    [ HAVING <replaceable class="PARAMETER">condition</replaceable> [, ...] ]
    [ { UNION [ ALL ] | INTERSECT | EXCEPT } <replaceable class="PARAMETER">select</replaceable> ]
    [ ORDER BY <replaceable class="PARAMETER">column</replaceable> [ ASC | DESC | USING <replaceable class="PARAMETER">operator</replaceable> ] [, ...] ]
    [ FOR UPDATE [ OF <replaceable class="PARAMETER">class_name</replaceable> [, ...] ] ]
    LIMIT { <replaceable class="PARAMETER">count</replaceable> | ALL } [ { OFFSET | , } <replaceable class="PARAMETER">start</replaceable> ]
  </synopsis>
  
  <refsect2 id="R2-SQL-SELECTINTO-1">
   <refsect2info>
    <date>1998-09-22</date>
   </refsect2info>
   <title>
    输入
   </title>
   <para>
    所有输入字段在<xref linkend="sql-select-title" endterm="sql-select-title">中有详细描述。
   </para>
  </refsect2>

  <refsect2 id="R2-SQL-SELECTINTO-2">
   <refsect2info>
    <date>1998-09-22</date>
   </refsect2info>
   <title>
    输出
   </title>
   <para>
    所有输出字段在<xref linkend="sql-select-title" endterm="sql-select-title">中有详细描述。
   </para>
  </refsect2>
 </refsynopsisdiv>

 <refsect1 id="R1-SQL-SELECTINTO-1">
  <refsect1info>
   <date>1998-09-22</date>
  </refsect1info>
  <title>描述</title>
  <para>
   <command>SELECT INTO</command> 从查询的结果创建一个新表。通常这个查询从现有的表提取数据，但允许任何
   SQL 查询。

   <note>
    <para>
     <xref linkend="sql-createtableas-title" endterm="sql-createtableas-title">在功能上等价于
     <command>SELECT INTO</command> 命令。
    </para>
   </note>
  </para>
 </refsect1>
</refentry>

